    "cof_readme": true
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Read me — how this workflow works\n\n**One node per category of the COF builder**, each in its own group below: 📝 Personality · 🖼️ Appearance · 🧊 3D · 👄 Voice · 🏃 Postures · 🎥 Motion · 📁 Files — and 🕰️ Memories (COF 1.1) last.\n\n- **The nodes are a fixed template**: only their **dropdown lists** follow the loaded file, preset and character. Another type (face, body, hair…): change **kind**; a node keeps its type, shown \"— 0 images\" if this preset has none.\n- **Add a node**: double-click an empty spot → type `COF` → choose the node → drag the **cof** output of *COF Load Character* to its **cof** input → connect a preview → Run.\n- **pick**: `mosaic_all` = every image (24 at most, then `mosaic_page_1`, `_2`…), `image_001`… = one image; `all` / `item_001`… for files.\n- **Missing content** gives silence, a blank image or an empty list, and says so: the run goes on. 🧬 Identity weights (LoRA, RefMods) need a model: see `cof_txt2img_api.json`.\n\nMore: github.com/yannsouetre/ComfyUI-COF"
   ],
   "title": "Read me",
   "color": "#0f6b5c",
   "bgcolor": "#18201f"
  },
